# xfig startup smoke test - validates that the toolbox, canvas, and
# indicator panel each map and paint at least one non-background pixel
# through the libXaw + libXt + libXft + libX11 compat stack. xfig's
# top-level form pulls in the bulk of the Athena widget surface
# (commandWidgetClass, formWidgetClass, viewportWidgetClass,
# asciiTextWidgetClass) so a clean startup paint exercises the
# Athena render path end to end.
delay 3000
wait-window "Xfig|xfig" 8000
delay 2000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial common-visible.json
assert-image initial xfig-three-panes.json
